{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42996","headline":"采菊 · 李建业","name":"采菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"簇簇竟相鲜，一枝开几番。\n味甘资麴{艹/糪}，香好胜兰荪。\n古道风摇远，荒篱露压繁。\n盈筐时采得，服饵近知门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建业","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}